  "definition": "Comprehensive Family and Consumer Science Education Teacher",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-08-16",
  "historyNote": "#8229, eff 12-17-04 (renumbered by #9157, from Ed 507.42); EXPIRED: 12-17-12 New. #11154, eff 8-16-16; renumbered by #12603 (formerly Ed 507.48)",
